### Topic 64 - Resilience4j demo (VS Code "REST Client": click "Send Request" above each block)
### Start inventory-service (8083) and store-service (8084). Run the requests IN ORDER.

@store = http://localhost:8084
@inv = http://localhost:8083

### 1. Normal call - real data, source "inventory-service"
GET {{store}}/api/store/stock/LAPTOP-1

### 2. Look at the circuit breaker: state CLOSED
GET {{store}}/actuator/circuitbreakers

### 3. Break the downstream - every call now returns HTTP 500
POST {{inv}}/api/inventory/chaos?mode=FAIL

### 4. Call again: Retry tries 3 times (see store-service log), then the fallback answers
###    with the LAST KNOWN value (source "fallback-last-known"). The circuit OPENS.
GET {{store}}/api/store/stock/LAPTOP-1

### 5. Call again: instant answer (~10 ms), note "Circuit breaker is OPEN"
###    inventory-service does NOT even receive the call any more.
GET {{store}}/api/store/stock/LAPTOP-1

### 6. State is now OPEN
GET {{store}}/actuator/circuitbreakers

### 7. Event history (SUCCESS, ERROR, STATE_TRANSITION, NOT_PERMITTED ...)
GET {{store}}/actuator/circuitbreakerevents

### 8. How many calls really reached inventory-service?
GET {{inv}}/api/inventory/chaos

### 9. Heal the downstream ...
POST {{inv}}/api/inventory/chaos?mode=OK

### 10. ... wait 10 seconds (wait-duration-in-open-state). State becomes HALF_OPEN.
###     Then send this 2 times: 2 successful trial calls -> CLOSED again.
GET {{store}}/api/store/stock/LAPTOP-1

### 11. TIME LIMITER: make inventory slow (4 s) ...
POST {{inv}}/api/inventory/chaos?mode=SLOW&delayMs=4000

### 12. ... the store gives up after 2 s and answers with a fallback
GET {{store}}/api/store/stock-fast/PHONE-7

### 13. back to normal
POST {{inv}}/api/inventory/chaos?mode=OK

### 14. RATE LIMITER: send this 4 times quickly - the 4th answer is the fallback text
GET {{store}}/api/store/deals

### 15. BULKHEAD: each report takes 3 s, only 2 at a time.
###     Run this 3 times very quickly (or use the curl loop from the lesson)
GET {{store}}/api/store/report/LAPTOP-1

### 16. Health shows circuit breaker details (app stays UP even if a breaker is OPEN)
GET {{store}}/actuator/health

### 17. Other actuator views
GET {{store}}/actuator/retries

###
GET {{store}}/actuator/ratelimiters

###
GET {{store}}/actuator/bulkheads
